WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:02.940
Blast your mind.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.500
Everything alright?

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.840
My name is Melinda.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.160
People don't usually give me the chance to get to know me.

00:00:17.015 --> 00:00:19.875
Hey. Diane left again without cleaning the bathrooms, already stalking.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.415
That's okay, I'll do it.

00:00:27.435 --> 00:00:30.025
Excuse me, Sir. It's against the rules

00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:31.235
to smoke near a pump.

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:34.805
What is there? Do I take this and stick it in the pump?

00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:36.725
I wasn't trying to be mean to you.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.180
How are you in there? Everything good tonight?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.300
Yeah, everything's good.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.040
Melinda, what the hell are you doing?

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.760
You are so

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:49.880
creepy.

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:55.595
Okay, everything inside. Both the registers

00:00:55.595 --> 00:00:56.885
and everything in the sink.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.780
What's your plan?

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.200
You're not even supposed to be here.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:18.940
It's too late.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:20.500
Is there anyone else in here with you?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.580
You gotta let me out of here. Ok, I'm not gonna hurt you.

00:01:23.885 --> 00:01:25.695
I know you're lying to me.

00:01:26.225 --> 00:01:28.725
The second I untie you I know you gonna kill me.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.960
Why do you keep crying?

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.220
Is everything alright?

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.880
Yes. You keep asking me that and I keep telling you yes.

00:01:35.245 --> 00:01:37.435
Let's get out of here while we still can together.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.460
Blast your mind.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:40.940
That's very possible.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.800
I burn myself all the time.

00:02:02.265 --> 00:02:03.525
It's not a bad thing.

00:02:03.525 --> 00:02:06.265
Fire just forces things to change really fast.

